Package: tcrhex
Title: Paired TCRdist Hex Rows from Single-Cell TCR Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("tcrhex", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tcrhex@example.invalid")
Description: Draws "paired TCRdist hex rows" with 'ggplot2' from single-cell
    T-cell receptor metadata ('scRepertoire', 10x Cell Ranger contigs, AIRR
    rearrangements or any data frame): one row per query TCR, one hexagonal
    frame per paired-TCRdist distance bin, one small hexagon per clone,
    coloured by any categorical column, with CDR3 logos. Paired TCRdist
    reproduces 'tcrdist3' human defaults exactly.
